  factText: "Mycelium makes delicious, sustainable food. By fermenting fungi on simple
    plant waste, companies create protein-rich mycoprotein ingredients (think the
    brand Quorn). This fungal protein has all essential amino acids, plus fiber and
    vitamins, but no saturated fat or cholesterol. It\u2019s a meat-free superfood!"
